  "term": "norepinephrine",
  "definition": "Norepinephrine is a chemical in the body and brain that serves as a widely distributed neurotransmitter in the central and autonomic nervous systems. It is released by the adrenal medulla, is the main transmitter of most postganglionic sympathetic nerves, and is a precursor of epinephrine.",
